45621::$$$message_0432_0000_0000$$$::"Hurrk...[wvl canskip=false time=200][hffacechg2 chara=雁夜 face=真剣2 pos=winner time=400 textclear=0][hfsweat layer=2 ox=-150 oy=50][hfangry layer=2] We fended them off... That was a temporary lapse of judgment... I know better now. I'm going to dedicate my life to Aoi and Sakura!"::
45622::$$$message_0432_0000_0001$$$::"Barely hanging on by a thread again... Honestly... He's such a feeble uncle, weaker than a bug. A breeze could knock him over..."::
45623::$$$message_0432_0000_0002$$$::"But...he really is trying his best..."::

